ent-ShipCutter = ship cutter
    .desc = A heavy battery powered plasma cutter for taking ships apart. Click walls and seams to queue cuts, and it works through them one by one. Use it in hand to drop the queue.

ship-cutter-cannot-cut = There is nothing to cut there.
ship-cutter-queue-full = The cutter queue is full.
ship-cutter-queue-cleared = You drop the cutting queue.
ship-cutter-skipped = Skipping a target that can not be cut.
ship-cutter-no-charge = The cutter is out of charge.
